<title>USA: USDA weekly export sales report delayed.</title>
<headline>USDA weekly export sales report delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Release of the Agriculture Department's weekly export sales report was delayed by 10 minutes on Thursday.</p>
<p>The department did not immediately give a reason for the delay. The report is scheduled for release each Thursday at 8:30 a.m. EDT (1230 GMT).</p>
